@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
title SplitSmart proposed component boundaries
package "Desktop MVP" {
  [Swing Views / Presenters] as Swing
  [HTTP DTO Adapter] as Adapter
  Swing --> Adapter : background I/O; EDT renders result
}
package "Future clients (required product scope)" {
  [Web] as Web
  [Android] as Android
  [iOS] as IOS
}
package "Java 21 modular monolith / Maven" {
  [HTTP + Session Authentication] as HTTP
  [Application Services\nIdentity / Group / Expense / Approval\nBalance / Settlement / Report / Receipt] as App
  [Domain Objects\nMoney / SplitAllocator / Policy / PairDebt] as Domain
  interface "Repository / Transaction / Delivery Ports" as Ports
  [JDBC + SQL Transactions] as JDBC
  [Private Receipt Adapter] as Receipt
  [Outbox Worker / Inbox Delivery] as Worker
  [Security Email Adapter] as Mail
  HTTP --> App : trusted principal + request
  App --> Domain
  App --> Ports
  JDBC ..|> Ports
  Receipt ..|> Ports
  Mail ..|> Ports
  Worker --> JDBC : committed outbox / unique inbox
}
Adapter --> HTTP : HTTPS /v1
Web --> HTTP : same proposed contracts
Android --> HTTP
IOS --> HTTP
database "SQL\nLedger + Pair Projection\nPolicies / Shares / Inbox / Outbox" as SQL
folder "Private Receipt Bytes" as Blobs
cloud "Email Delivery" as Email
JDBC --> SQL
Receipt --> Blobs
Mail --> Email
Worker --> Mail : identity verification/recovery
note bottom of Domain
No dependency on Swing, HTTP, SQL or floating-point money.
All financial writes are authoritative service transactions.
end note
note right of SQL
Final approval/payment + ledger + projection
+ idempotency result commit atomically.
end note
note bottom of Worker
Notification retry failure never reverses expense submission.
In-product submission audience excludes submitter.
end note
@enduml
